><p dir="ltr"
><span dir="ltr" style="font-size:-14.0pt;text-align:left;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal"
>Q14b: there was no clear reflection of the results on practical outcomes.</span
></p
></body
></contents-richtext
><popup flags="print,nozoom,norotate" open="no" page="10" rect="595.276001,408.343353,779.276001,500.343353"
